    "metadata":  {
                     "title":  "Calculation and Simulation Data for Modular Oxy-Combustion and Carbon Capture in Associated Petroleum Gas Valorization",
                     "doi":  "10.5281/zenodo.18806107",
                     "publication_date":  "2026-02-27",
                     "description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis dataset contains the supporting calculations and process simulations for the study\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003e\u0026ldquo;Decentralized Valorization of Associated Petroleum Gas via Modular Oxy-Combustion and Carbon Capture.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/em\u003e It includes Excel spreadsheets with flaring statistics and thermodynamic balances, Aspen HYSYS v12.1 models of oxy-combustion and CO₂ capture systems, and Engineering Equation Solver (EES) files for energy and exergetic efficiency analysis. The dataset provides reproducible evidence for the manuscript\u0026rsquo;s reported performance metrics and supports transparency in energy systems research.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e",
